# Worker environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local development.
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# For production, set these with:
#   wrangler secret put OPENROUTER_API_KEY
#   wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN

# ── Required ──────────────────────────────────

# OpenRouter API key — used by POST /api/analyze to call LLMs via OpenRouter.
# Get one at https://openrouter.io/keys
# Format: sk-or-v1-...
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────

# GitHub personal access token — increases rate limits when calling the
# GitHub API during repository indexing (POST /api/repositories/:id/index).
# Without it you get 60 req/hour (unauthenticated). With it: 5000 req/hour.
# Generate at https://github.com/settings/tokens — no scopes needed for public repos.
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your-token-here
